#: scenario9:scenario9_CC95A959_3809_4FE9_AAC3_5963A5D0B1FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfaf9c58459e26d9fb774d72638e78c0e3c5b39c5092b5a3e5d736b66659ad7c
#. default-sha256: d5573d9773df7769ee21c990cb685d141f258340cd13292350293328d4c27b0c
